{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>But</b> — there is no one who will contend with another or reprove him. The judgment of the priests was to reprove Israel, and now they have reversed to reprove the priest, for he too is evil in deeds, as will be explained. This is the meaning of \"and your people are like those who contend with the priest.\""], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:49:59.600222951Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}